Cell[TextData[{
 "These are the properly ordered topologically irreducible diagrams we employ \
in our UV completion code. Notice, in particular, that the four-fermion \
three-scalar diagram from before indeed comes out properly ordered now after \
doing the swapping:\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     GraphicsBox[
      NamespaceBox["NetworkGraphics",
       DynamicModuleBox[{Typeset`graph = HoldComplete[
         Graph[{
