Cell["\<\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Fulllistoftopologies\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] can now \
be exported and used for any operator involving the same number of external \
bosons and fermions. We provide such exported topology files for most cases \
of interest in addition to this notebook, but others can easily be generated \
as shown here.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.936452537551189*^9, 3.9364525797149057`*^9}, {
  3.9364526600456467`*^9, 
  3.9364527166653557`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bc5fb8b5-97c9-476a-a52e-\
7b16b1154443"]
}, Closed]],

